Common EnglishLanguageProficiencyAssessment
    documentation "Results of yearly English language assessment."
    enumeration SchoolYear
        documentation "The school year for which the assessment was administered."
        is part of identity
    descriptor Participation
        documentation "Field indicating the participation in the yearly English language assessment."
        is optional
    descriptor Proficiency
        documentation "The proficiency level for the yearly English language assessment."
        is optional
    descriptor Progress
        documentation "The yearly progress or growth from last year's assessment."
        is optional
    descriptor Monitored
        documentation "Student is monitored on content achievement who are no longer receiving services."
        is optional
